    <div>
            <h3><a href=3D"https://portswigger.net/research/james-kettle">J=
ames Kettle</a></h3>
        <p>Director of Research</p>
        <p>
           =20
<span class=3D"icon-twitter"></span>
<a href=3D"https://twitter.com/albinowax">@albinowax</a>
